11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Sometimes there will be questions that are about models.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
And when a question is about a model, you should just talk about the model.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
So in the coordination game, how many of the delivery are there? Then don't start talking about Esperanto.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Then there's no need to

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
